  <DefaultMacro>
    <Major></Major>
    <Description>The macro includes the attachment of a suppressor to your weapon, which helps reduce the noise generated by the gunfire. The sensitivity setting for the game is set to 2, and the DPI setting is at 600, ensuring a smooth and precise aim.

Furthermore, the macro is optimized for a screen resolution of 1920x1080, allowing for clear and crisp visuals. The macro removes both the side recoil and vertical recoil of the Ak-12, providing you with improved accuracy and control over your shots.
Sens-600 dpi 20 in game
Resolution-1920x1080</Description>
